      "text": "有情综艺"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": 6.6,
      "end": 8.0,
      "text": "没事由于你粗对象众自信有"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": 8.0,
      "end": 9.0,
      "text": "所以接下来一个月"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": 9.0,
      "end": 10.0,
      "text": "你将会你朋友相处"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": 10.0,
      "end": 10.6,
      "text": "现在开始"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": 10.6,
      "end": 11.8,
      "text": "不是我对这儿怎么讲话"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": 11.8,
      "end": 12.4,
      "text": "开始"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": 12.4,
      "end": 13.6,
      "text": "那你到底在写诗干啥呀"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": 13.6,
      "end": 15.0,
      "text": "你看谁来了"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": 18.14,
      "end": 19.14,
      "text": "能帮我写诗干啥呢"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": 19.14,
      "end": 20.54,
      "text": "粗对象到我们成功了"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": 20.54,
      "end": 21.34,
      "text": "你谁呀"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": 21.34,
      "end": 22.14,
      "text": "我老师嘛"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": 22.14,
      "end": 22.94,
      "text": "老师"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": 22.94,
      "end": 23.94,
      "text": "要变这样的呢"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": 23.94,
      "end": 25.34,
      "text": "你以后当了生命成绩"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": 25.34,
      "end": 26.34,
      "text": "你显然这样"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": 26.34,
      "end": 27.34,
      "text": "有情保卫站"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": 27.34,
      "end": 28.34,
      "text": "现在开始"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": 31.26,
      "end": 31.86,
      "text": "二"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start": 31.86,
      "end": 32.46,
      "text": "三点了"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start": 32.46,
      "end": 33.06,
      "text": "害大"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start": 33.06,
      "end": 34.46,
      "text": "我从里有这么闹心呢"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start": 34.46,
      "end": 35.46,
      "text": "我想我对象呢"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start": 35.46,
      "end": 36.86,
      "text": "朋友比对象重要"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start": 36.86,
      "end": 37.46,
      "text": "有啥呀"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start": 37.46,
      "end": 38.46,
      "text": "因为我没有对象"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start": 38.46,
      "end": 39.46,
      "text": "那你不废话吧"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start": 39.46,
      "end": 40.86,
      "text": "你朋友在一起多好啊"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start": 40.86,
      "end": 41.86,
      "text": "能一起打服务"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start": 41.86,
      "end": 42.66,
      "text": "能一起吃饭"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start": 42.66,
      "end": 43.66,
      "text": "还能一起闹客人呢"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start": 43.66,
      "end": 44.26,
      "text": "能轻左手"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start": 44.26,
      "end": 44.86,
      "text": "我想轻左手"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start": 44.86,
      "end": 45.66,
      "text": "我要试试"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start": 45.66,
      "end": 46.46,
      "text": "就上一两句"
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "start": 46.46,
      "end": 47.26,
      "text": "导演呐"
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "start": 47.86,
      "end": 48.66,
      "text": "你老板个脸"
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "start": 48.66,
      "end": 49.66,
      "text": "是人种是的"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "start": 49.66,
      "end": 50.86,
      "text": "花我我也不原谅你"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "start": 50.86,
      "end": 51.66,
      "text": "我宽敞了"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "start": 51.66,
      "end": 53.06,
      "text": "原种就是恩怨分明"
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "start": 53.06,
      "end": 54.66,
      "text": "并且非常有种的男人"
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "start": 54.66,
      "end": 55.86,
      "text": "我是大个种"
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "start": 55.86,
      "end": 56.66,
      "text": "还是这么理解"
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "start": 56.66,
      "end": 57.86,
      "text": "我不是动作性有"
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "start": 57.86,
      "end": 58.86,
      "text": "我是脑子里处理"
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "start": 58.86,
      "end": 60.46,
      "text": "不过来这种亲密关系"
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "start": 60.46,
      "end": 61.66,
      "text": "有异性为人性呗"
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "start": 61.66,
      "end": 62.26,
      "text": "这么话"
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "start": 62.26,
      "end": 63.06,
      "text": "这么话就是"
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "start": 63.06,
      "end": 63.86,
      "text": "我见了律师呗"
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "start": 63.86,
      "end": 64.46,
      "text": "你见了律师呗"
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "start": 64.46,
      "end": 65.06,
      "text": "别靠着"
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "start": 65.06,
      "end": 66.26,
      "text": "你玩会儿梦魂心游往夜晚"
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "start": 66.26,
      "end": 67.66,
      "text": "现实缺失的不怂感"
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "start": 67.66,
      "end": 68.86,
      "text": "这里三秒就能给你点"
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "start": 68.86,
      "end": 69.66,
      "text": "不用你说"
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "start": 69.66,
      "end": 70.86,
      "text": "梦魂我从小玩的大的"
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "start": 70.86,
      "end": 71.66,
      "text": "下一回你"
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "start": 71.66,
      "end": 72.26,
      "text": "结伴"
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "start": 72.26,
      "end": 73.26,
      "text": "开始结伴"
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "start": 73.26,
      "end": 74.06,
      "text": "我李宗恒"
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "start": 74.06,
      "end": 74.86,
      "text": "我魏宝坑"
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "start": 74.86,
      "end": 75.66,
      "text": "再次结伴"
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "start": 75.66,
      "end": 77.06,
      "text": "不小同年同月"
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "start": 77.06,
      "end": 77.86,
      "text": "同日生"
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "start": 77.86,
      "end": 79.06,
      "text": "但你小同年"
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "start": 79.06,
      "end": 80.06,
      "text": "等会儿"
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "start": 80.06,
      "end": 81.06,
      "text": "你到底多大岁数"
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "start": 81.06,
      "end": 82.26,
      "text": "我比你小两月"
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "start": 82.26,
      "end": 83.26,
      "text": "他比我小两月"
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "start": 83.26,
